OL,3,GNEWSAMy son has disappeared off the
OL,4,Aface of the earth fighting for Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish man Nathan Stobbart has been
OL,7,Fdeclared missing in action while
OL,8,Ffighting for Russia in Ukraine. He kept
OL,9,Fhis military service a secret from his
OL,10,Ffamily in the UK, who are now
OL,11,Fdesperately trying to find him.
OL,13,FIn December 2025, Nathan's mother
OL,14,FValerie Stobbart received a text
OL,15,Fmessage that plunged her life into
OL,16,Fturmoil.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
