OL,3,GNEWSAMy son has disappeared off the
OL,4,Aface of the earth fighting for Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was from her panic-stricken
OL,7,Fdaughter-in-law, Ksenia, who lives in
OL,8,FRussia with Valerie's 30-year-old son
OL,9,Fand the couple's newborn baby. Nathan
OL,10,Fhad been fighting for the country
OL,11,Fagainst Ukraine and had vanished.
OL,13,F"I can't even describe it," Valerie
OL,14,Fsays.
